Commands
------------
1. Install Terraform On MacOS
brew install hashicorp/tap/terraform
2. AWS CLI
brew install awscli
3. kubectl
brew install kubectl
4. Helm
brew install helm
5. eksctl
brew install eksctl
6. Docker
brew install --cask docker
7. Terragrunt
brew install terragrunt


Terraform Commands
------------------
# Initialize Terraform
terraform init

# Format configuration files
terraform fmt -recursive

# Validate configuration
terraform validate

# Preview infrastructure changes
terraform plan

# Provision infrastructure after reviewing the plan
terraform apply

# Inspect deployed resources
terraform state list

# Display infrastructure outputs
terraform output
